{
  "main_content": {
    "subject": "Male soldier in heavy combat armor",
    "clothing": "Heavy white and gray tactical exosuit with black accents, showing signs of wear including rust stains, scuffs, dirt, and what appears to be dried blood on the shoulders, thighs, knees, and boots. The suit has a thick neck seal, shoulder pads connected by segmented plates, armored gauntlets, reinforced knee guards, and heavy combat boots.",
