      "Two large grey hoses protruding from the back of the helmet/shoulder section connecting to a central circular component on chestplate (possibly an air supply system)",
      "A small red indicator light embedded into the right shoulder plate near collar area",
      "Yellow triangular warning label with black text reading 'HARDWARE WARNING' and smaller unreadable text below it, affixed onto upper part of rifle's stock. The gun itself has a matte dark grey finish with an orange safety lever or grip accent on its side.",
      "The soldier is wearing thick gloves that fully cover his hands"
    ]
